 "text": "Hi, I'm here to help. How can I assist you? No problem. How can I assist you? It' not rude to ask, but I'm not able to check after every meal. We'll be done soon, and I'll check then. If you need to go, I can help you find the door. We're all paying for the meal, so it's best to pay your portion upfront. It's usually about $5 per person. I' make sure we take turns, so no one has to pay more than once. It's all part of being polite and considerate.",
